  "seed": "The far rows of a 50 track edit sleep until they come near the part on screen (TimelineRowsInSight). Zoomed while they sleep, then wheeled to: they show the window as it is now, and a hand that reaches one works at once. A box drawn on a track that was asleep picks the clip under it, and a video track added off the + has its row at the top, named, pressed and renamed, and the undo takes it away. At Next defaults.",
